  "description": "Kev decision model definitions (jaredpalmer/kev-0.8b and jaredpalmer/kev-4b, Kev 1.0) without a runtime: typed requests (one state and noul, choice and score questions, or a System One request body), Kev's request rendering and delimiter escaping in C#, the encoder that turns a request into Kev's state and question rows of token ids with the owned tokenizer (Starlings.Tokenizers profile qwen2-bpe-kev: no Microsoft.ML.Tokenizers), the checkpoints' identities and dimensions (KevModelProfile), and the decision result types. No ONNX Runtime dependency. To run the models in-process on ONNX Runtime, reference Starlings.Models.Kev.Onnx. Maturity is per model profile (Stable, Preview or Experimental): see the README, generated from the model registry.",
